{"architectures":["arm64","x64","x86"],"id":"Anthropic.Ant","latestVersion":"2.7.1","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"author":"Anthropic PBC","copyright":"Copyright 2026 Anthropic, PBC.","description":"Interact with the Claude API directly from your terminal with the ant command-line tool","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/anthropics/anthropic-cli/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"author":"Anthropic PBC","copyright":"Copyright 2026 Anthropic, PBC.","description":"Interact with the Claude API directly from your terminal with the ant command-line tool","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/anthropics/anthropic-cli/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"The ant CLI provides access to the Claude API from your terminal. Every API resource is exposed as a subcommand, with output formatting, response filtering, and support for YAML or JSON file input that make it practical for both interactive exploration and automation.\nCompared to calling the API with curl, ant lets you build request bodies from typed flags or piped YAML rather than hand-written JSON, inline file contents into string fields with an @path reference, and extract fields from the response with a built-in --transform query (no separate JSON tooling required). List endpoints paginate automatically. Claude Code understands how to use ant natively.","name":"Claude Platform CLI","packageUrl":"https://github.com/anthropics/anthropic-cli","publisher":"Anthropic PBC","releaseNotes":"Chores\n- docs: say when a work heartbeat does not compare its value","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/anthropics/anthropic-cli/releases/tag/v2.7.1","tags":["claude"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"通过 ant 命令行工具直接从终端与 Claude API 交互","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"ant CLI 可让你通过终端访问 Claude API。每个 API 资源都以子命令的形式暴露，支持输出格式化、响应过滤，并可使用 YAML 或 JSON 文件输入，适用于交互式探索和自动化操作。\n与使用 curl 调用 API 相比，ant 允许你通过类型化的标志或管道传入的 YAML 来构建请求体，而无需手动编写 JSON；通过 @path 引用将文件内容内联到字符串字段中；并使用内置的 --transform 查询从响应中提取字段（无需额外的 JSON 工具）。列表接口会自动分页。Claude Code 能够原生理解如何使用 ant。"}},"longDescription":"The ant CLI provides access to the Claude API from your terminal. Every API resource is exposed as a subcommand, with output formatting, response filtering, and support for YAML or JSON file input that make it practical for both interactive exploration and automation.\nCompared to calling the API with curl, ant lets you build request bodies from typed flags or piped YAML rather than hand-written JSON, inline file contents into string fields with an @path reference, and extract fields from the response with a built-in --transform query (no separate JSON tooling required). List endpoints paginate automatically. Claude Code understands how to use ant natively.","name":"Claude Platform CLI","packageUrl":"https://github.com/anthropics/anthropic-cli","publisher":"Anthropic PBC","releaseNotes":"Chores\n- docs: say when a work heartbeat does not compare its value","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/anthropics/anthropic-cli/releases/tag/v2.7.1","tags":["claude"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["arm64","x64","x86"],"detailPath":"versions/2.7.1/app.json","detailSha256":"b92a913733ae60e81933866483ba164eec1920d4c6ca8940937954930742c1eb","releaseDate":"2026-11-06","releaseDateSource":"commit","version":"2.7.1"},{"architectures":["arm64","x64","x86"],"detailPath":"versions/2.7.0/app.json","detailSha256":"8eeaf8915c70311a5328674466eeec07e4f69d7b3e03c7dc8ddadb2ab7f0cc7a","releaseDate":"2026-11-05","releaseDateSource":"commit","version":"2.7.0"},{"architectures":["arm64","x64","x86"],"detailPath":"versions/2.6.0/app.json","detailSha256":"2eee65ef63e43b8d8042bbcbd77038563aef4c9f32b96feb1bb373c2c224de5b","releaseDate":"2026-11-04","releaseDateSource":"commit","version":"2.6.0"},{"architectures":["arm64","x64","x86"],"detailPath":"versions/2.5.0/app.json","detailSha256":"67ad771ef041c09505719d36369d2f441ab7bd22986545b0c40c3dc49ae06ae4","rele